  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Next Generation Early Grade Reading (NextGen) Flagship Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Malawi):  Using FY 2022 funds, USAID will complete a performance evaluation of the Next Generation Early Grade Reading flagship activity (NextGen). Building on the U.S. government&apos;s investments in the National Reading Program, the evaluation will support the Ministry of Education and continue to build its capacity in conducting National Reading Assessments to measure students&apos; reading outcomes. The evaluation will also inform the learning and adaptive management of NextGen and its contributions to USAID-supported National Reading Program objectives. The evaluation will meet the requirements for evaluating large activities set forth in ADS 201 and will enhance evidence-based decision making related to early grade and pre-primary reading interventions, It will support the U.S. government&apos;s Basic Education Strategy and the Integrated Country Strategy  Mission Objective 3.3 - Malawi expands educational opportunity to equip its citizens with foundational and marketable skills responsive to Malawi&apos;s public and private sector needs. This evaluation will also support the Mission&apos;s strategy development objective: &quot;Youth lead healthy, informed, and productive lives&quot;. ..</narrative>
  </description>
